.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Provides a numeric comparison implementation for values wrapped in \fBOptional<T>\fP where \fIT\fP  implements INumber<T>\&. 

This comparer supports both strict and non‑strict relational operators, enabling finer‑grained comparison results for numeric types\&.

.PP
